    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the dimly lit sub-basement of Blackwood Manor, the former workshop of a notoriously reclusive cryptographer who vanished decades ago. The heavy steel door behind you is hermetically sealed. Dominating the center of the room is a massive, menacing mechanical vault door, humming with a strange, latent energy. Scattered across the decaying workbenches are various cryptic machines, interconnected by a chaotic web of thick cables and glowing data lines. Your only hope of escape is to unravel this complex network of devices, restoring the flow of information to eventually power up the master override mechanism. Time is ticking, and the shadows in the corners of the room seem to grow longer by the minute.",
    "narrative_style": "mystery"
  },
